  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mulanje Bauxite Feasibility/Pilot Study</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of the feasibility study are:  - to assess the potential of developing of the Mulanje bauxite  deposits;  - to identify the need for aluminum products in the region; and   - to evaluate the feasibility of reducing the regional dependence on imported bauxite products.</narrative>
  </description>
